# GEMINI_FINAL_ATTENDANCE_PIPELINE_FIX.md

Read this entire file before changing the repository.

This is a focused engineering pass for the Smart Attendance System. Do not rewrite the project from scratch.

The project is intended to become an offline classroom attendance appliance using a Jetson-class compute device and a USB-UVC camera module. The camera will be mounted at the front of classrooms and the system must work across different classroom sizes and layouts.

The immediate goal is to make the existing face-recognition, burst, liveness, anti-spoofing, and attendance pipeline technically coherent and safe before hardware integration.

