# 15. Tests

Add or update deterministic tests for:

## Burst aggregation

- one frame cannot commit attendance
- multiple consistent observations can
- one bad frame does not invalidate a good track
- insufficient observations produce unresolved
- conflicting identities are handled safely
- one attendance record per student/window

## Small faces

- trackable-small face remains tracked
- later safe frame enables recognition
- all-small observations become unresolved
- tiny unusable faces do not force recognition

## PAD

- multi-frame PAD is actually used
- minimum valid PAD samples are respected
- spoof fails
- PAD error fails closed
- model unavailable fails closed
- diagnostic fallback cannot authorize attendance

## Quality

- mild lighting variation does not automatically reject
- severe image failure still rejects

## Three-window voting

Test:

```text
A = PRESENT
B = PRESENT
C = UNRESOLVED
-> PRESENT
```

and other combinations according to the existing policy.

## Performance

Where practical, measure:

- preview responsiveness
- camera FPS
- inference latency
- burst processing time

